//   - insert_split.c:36: R_Free(s3) immediately followed by CALLOC(1, splitsize)
//     into the same variable; the NULL assignment from R_Free is overwritten.
//   - insert_split.c:63: identical pattern for s4.
//   - xval.c:179: R_Free(xtemp) releases the entire block; xpred and cp are
